{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a Cyberpunk world, or better said, into its cyber space, to protect servers from the malicious hackers that threaten it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Arms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/19547b74f58a2207badcfca22574c881.poster.avif?t=1772282253\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/19547b74f58a2207badcfca22574c881.webm?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/19547b74f58a2207badcfca22574c881.mp4?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Place an incredible variety of towers, or in this case Arms, at the different nodes of the computer network, which will not only be your means of attack but also your defense against the malwares that hackers created and intend to infect the server.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/29634d2c5ca532238e60ed0b604f71f1.poster.avif?t=1772282253\" width=396 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/29634d2c5ca532238e60ed0b604f71f1.webm?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of 5 Modules with special features in your towers to improve their attack or resistance; any extra help will be necessary to prevent malware from infecting the server.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Malware</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/3c4e064f2f9f00a2cef4b97eed9f5e0c.poster.avif?t=1772282253\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/3c4e064f2f9f00a2cef4b97eed9f5e0c.webm?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/3c4e064f2f9f00a2cef4b97eed9f5e0c.mp4?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hackers who attempt to infect the server will do everything possible to achieve their goal, where you will not only face malware, but also trojans, viruses, spyware, and other malicious software that will sneak through the network until it reaches the server.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the siblings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/3fb53131ad057a963290ec73eb4b859f.poster.avif?t=1772282253\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/3fb53131ad057a963290ec73eb4b859f.webm?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/3fb53131ad057a963290ec73eb4b859f.mp4?t=1772282253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, follows the adventures of a pair of orphaned siblings trying to carve out a place for themselves in the world of future cybersecurity. Join them during the years it takes to become one of the best cybersecurity companies, see how they work for various companies and meet a variety of characters while you learn more about the past of these brothers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special levels: During your adventure, you will encounter levels where you will stop playing a classic tower defense and unique mechanics will be introduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Social and Technical: Enemies will have resistance to a specific type of attack and will be vulnerable to others; you will have to choose what type of attack to base your strategy on if you want to overcome the hordes of malware.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3799900?t=1772282253","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/b7c43fe88e574faa286adca8db2777b4dc97da74/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772282253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/1d6b3c9cdc068a6e9403e1874ba8c41897c28ff3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772282253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/1d6b3c9cdc068a6e9403e1874ba8c41897c28ff3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772282253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mention of the use of drugs and alcohol; and allusion to sex and suicide."},"demos":[{"appid":3800730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a Cyberpunk world, or better said, into its cyber space, to protect servers from the malicious hackers that threaten it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Place Arms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900/extras/19547b74f58a2207badcfca22574c881.poster.avif?t=1772282253\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799900